### 1. Pobierz aktywne alerty dla Ula 1 (Z migracji V2)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/hives/b1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/alerts

###

### 2. TEST REŻIMU SANITARNEGO: Próba miodobrania na Ulu 2 (w trakcie leczenia)
# Powinno zwrócić HTTP 409 Conflict z informacją o leku Apivar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/hives/b2000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002/harvest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetSuperCount": 2,
  "operatorNotes": "Attempting summer honey harvest"
}

###

### 3. TEST DSS: Zgłoszenie inspekcji z objawami CICHEJ WYMIANY (Hive 3)
# Powinno zwrócić HTTP 201 Created oraz alert SUPERSEDURE: "Do NOT destroy queen cells"
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/inspections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hiveId": "b3000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
  "framesOfBees": 8,
  "framesOfBrood": 4,
  "honeyStoresKg": 6.50,
  "freeCombSpacePercent": 35.00,
  "queenSeen": true,
  "broodPattern": "SPOTTY",
  "queenCellsCount": 2,
  "queenCellsPlacement": "CENTRAL",
  "queenCellsStage": "OPEN_WITH_LARVA",
  "varroaMiteCount": 2,
  "signsOfPests": false,
  "temperamentScore": 5,
  "notes": "Testing supersedure detection via HTTP"
}

###

### 4. TEST DSS: Zgłoszenie inspekcji z objawami KRYTYCZNEJ RÓJKI (Hive 1)
# Powinno zwrócić HTTP 201 Created oraz alert REPRODUCTIVE_SWARM (CRITICAL)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/inspections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hiveId": "b1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "framesOfBees": 12,
  "framesOfBrood": 8,
  "honeyStoresKg": 16.00,
  "freeCombSpacePercent": 4.00,
  "queenSeen": true,
  "broodPattern": "SOLID_COMPACT",
  "queenCellsCount": 9,
  "queenCellsPlacement": "MARGINAL",
  "queenCellsStage": "SEALED",
  "varroaMiteCount": 1,
  "signsOfPests": false,
  "temperamentScore": 4,
  "notes": "Colony heavily congested, multiple swarm cells on bottom bars"
}